3. CLTK Latin lemmata                                                                    MIT
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   https://github.com/cltk/latin_pos_lemmata_cltk
   Shipped as the extract lemmata/cltk_lemmata.txt. The raw source is not redistributed here.

